      "title": "生成说明",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 小龙生成器\n\n这是训练完成后的主工作流，默认一次生成 4 张。\n\n## 推荐提示词结构\n```text\ntldragon, cute chibi red-orange baby dragon mascot, oversized head, small body, glossy red scales, cream belly, golden antlers, big sparkling eyes, cheerful smile, 3D cartoon render, Pixar style, [场景], [动作], [道具]\n```\n\n## 可直接替换的场景\n- `standing on a bright university campus, holding a blue test tube`\n- `working in a colorful science laboratory, beakers and molecule holograms`\n- `giving a presentation in front of a whiteboard`\n- `reading a book in a cozy library`\n- `dancing with confetti at a campus festival`\n- `full body character design, waving, plain cream background`\n\n## 当前推荐强度\n- 模型：`0.88`\n- CLIP：`0.78`\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
